          </p>
          <div class="rauthor">James M.</div>
          <div class="rsource">Verified Local</div>
        </div>
        <div class="rcard" role="article">
          <div class="rstars">★★★★★</div>
          <p class="rtext">
            "Best gift sets in town. I sent the 'Taste of Italy' box to my
            sister in Birmingham and she hasn't stopped talking about it."
          </p>
          <div class="rauthor">Elena R.</div>
          <div class="rsource">Verified Local</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="gifts" id="gifts">
      <div class="gifts-inner">
        <span class="sec-eyebrow">Perfect for Any Occasion</span>
        <h2>Give the Gift of <em>Thyme</em></h2>
        <p>
          From corporate appreciation to wedding favors, our custom-wrapped gift
          sets are the perfect way to share your love of flavor.
        </p>
        <div class="gift-btns">
          <button class="btn-cream" aria-label="Shop gift baskets">
            Browse Gift Baskets
          </button>
          <button class="btn-ghost-c" aria-label="Order corporate gifts">
            Corporate Gifting
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="email-section" id="club">
      <div class="email-inner">
        <span class="sec-eyebrow">Stay Inspired</span>
        <h2>Join Our <em>Tasting</em> List</h2>
        <p>
          Be the first to know about new seasonal pressings, upcoming tasting
          events, and exclusive recipes delivered to your inbox.
        </p>
        <form
          class="email-form"
          onsubmit="
            event.preventDefault();
            showToast('Welcome to the club!');
            this.style.display = 'none';
            document.querySelector('.email-success').style.display = 'block';
          "
        >
          <input
            type="email"
            class="email-input"
            placeholder="Your email address"
            required
            aria-label="Email address for newsletter"
          />
          <button
            type="submit"
            class="email-submit"
            aria-label="Subscribe to newsletter"
          >
            Sign Me Up
          </button>
        </form>
        <div class="email-success">
          Thank you for joining! Check your inbox for a 10% discount code.
        </div>
        <p class="email-note">
          We value your privacy. Unsubscribe at any time.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="visit" id="visit">
      <div class="visit-inner">
        <div class="visit-text">
          <span class="sec-eyebrow">Come Say Hello</span>
          <h2>Visit the <em>Shop</em></h2>
          <div class="visit-details">
            <div class="vi">
              <div class="vi-icon">📍</div>
              <div class="vi-text">
                <strong>Location</strong>
                <span>123 Market Street<br />Wetumpka, AL 36092</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="vi">
              <div class="vi-icon">📞</div>
              <div class="vi-text">
                <strong>Contact</strong>
                <a href="tel:3345678901" aria-label="Call store">334.567.8901</a
